{
  "name": "Paper",
  "name_ru": "Бумага",
  "note": "Paper / sketchbook: panels are sheets of paper with a torn bottom edge, grain and a strip of tape, handwritten Caveat, a paper bar, a paper grain shader over the whole screen and calm motion. Colours stay the theme's: a light theme gives white paper, a dark one — kraft.",
